# 5.4 the USB3 hub drops (camera gone, HID present) and comes back by itself after 4 s (07:10): the broker exited,
# SLAM cannot reconnect, so the broker and Monado's subtree restart in desk mode.
start desk
at 10 down usb.cam broker passthrough ctrltrack
expect 12 notified Camera dropped: 6DoF and passthrough paused
expect 13 runs 0
expect 13 health monado degraded
at 14 up usb.cam
expect 15 ran stop-subtree broker
expect 30 ran start monado
expect 50 overall ok
